## 2. `_kb_state_path` / `_load_kb_state` / `_save_kb_state` 现状（R-0 第 2 项）

源码原文（`kb_pipeline.py:197-216`，逐行核对）：

```python
def _kb_state_path(store_root) -> Path:
    return Path(store_root) / "kb_state.json"


def _load_kb_state(store_root) -> Dict[str, Dict[str, Any]]:
    path = _kb_state_path(store_root)
    if not path.is_file():
        return {}
    try:
        return json.loads(path.read_text(encoding="utf-8")) or {}
    except (OSError, ValueError):
        return {}          # ← 损坏静默返回空态（待修缺陷，G3/R-3 目标）


def _save_kb_state(store_root, state: Dict[str, Dict[str, Any]]) -> None:
    path = _kb_state_path(store_root)
    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
    tmp = path.with_suffix(".json.tmp")   # ← 固定临时名，无 flock（G3/R-4 目标）
    tmp.write_text(json.dumps(state, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1), encoding="utf-8")
    os.replace(tmp, path)
```

